curity-management/threat-group-to-technique-heatmap-definition.md","line":247},{"title":"threat group to technique mapping","target":"review-threat-group-and-techniques-mapping","line":248},{"title":"detection rules mapping","target":"create-detection-rules","line":267},{"title":"CVE - Technique Mapping module","target":"manage-cve-and-technique-mapping","line":271},{"title":"Vulnerabilities","target":"vulnerabilities","line":271},{"title":"Vulnerability Response","target":"vuln-landing-page","line":275},{"title":"MITRE-ATT&amp;CK properties","target":"configure-mitre-att-ck-properties","line":280},{"title":"Map your technique detection coverage to a technique","target":"map-technique-coverage","line":312},{"title":"Using MITRE-ATT&amp;CK to detect and analyze threats","target":"mitre-att-ck-features","line":313},{"title":"Set up the MITRE-ATT&amp;CK framework","target":"setup-mitre-profile","line":314},{"title":"Manage matrices","target":"view-mitre-collection","line":315},{"title":"Manage techniques","target":"view-techniques","line":316},{"title":"Define the technique detection coverage","target":"define-technique-coverage","line":317},{"title":"Define the mitigation coverage","target":"define-the-mitigation-coverage","line":318},{"title":"Map your mitigation coverage to a technique","target":"map-your-mitigation-coverage-to-a-technique","line":319},{"title":"Threat group to technique heatmap definition","target":"threat-group-to-technique-heatmap-definition","line":320},{"title":"Review threat group and MITRE-ATT&amp;CK techniques mapping","target":"review-threat-group-and-techniques-mapping","line":321},{"title":"Create and map detection rules","target":"create-detection-rules","line":322},{"title":"Manage CVE and technique mapping","target":"manage-cve-and-technique-mapping","line":323},{"title":"Review the MITRE-ATT&amp;CK system properties","target":"configure-mitre-att-ck-properties","line":324},{"title":"Threat Lookup","target":"tisc-threat-lookup","line":325},{"title":"Observables","target":"c_Observables","line":326},{"title":"Threat Intelligence","target":"threat-intel-landing-page","line":327},{"title":"MITRE-ATT&amp;CK Repository","target":"tisc-mitre-att-ck-framework-overview","line":328},{"title":"Threat actors","target":"threat-actors","line":329},{"title":"Campaigns","target":"threat-intelligence-campaigns","line":330},{"title":"Tools","target":"tools","line":331},{"title":"Malware","target":"threat-intelligence-malware","line":332},{"title":"Data Sources","target":"data-sources","line":333},{"title":"Vulnerabilities","target":"vulnerabilities","line":334},{"title":"Vulnerability Response","target":"vuln-landing-page","line":335}],"metadata":{"title":"MITRE-ATT&amp;CK heat map and navigator","description":"You can use the MITRE-ATT&amp;CK heat map and navigator for basic navigation and to visualize your overall technique detection coverage.Access the MITRE-ATT&amp;CK heat map and navigator so that you can visualize the matrix that enables you to use ATT&amp;CK.Custom views in the MITRE-ATT&amp;CK heat map and navigator help you to save and view your favorite filters the next time that you land on the heat map.Use the primary filters to filter techniques in the MITRE-ATT&amp;CK navigator. The information in the MITRE-ATT&amp;CK repository is available for selection.You can use a heat map with advanced filters to perform an analysis by correlating security incidents with MITRE-ATT&amp;CK information.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/security-management/mitre-att-ck-heatmap-and-navigator.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":18,"breadcrumb":["Using MITRE-ATT&amp;CK to detect and analyze threats","MITRE-ATT&amp;CK framework overview","Threat Intelligence","Enterprise security case management applications","Security Operations"],"tags":["#security-management","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/security-management/mitre-att-ck-heatmap-and-navigator.md"},
